### =====================================================
### Register Bulk - POST /account/register-bulk
### Registro de hasta 20 usuarios por request (autenticado).
### Los errores por usuario regresan en data.errors dentro
### del 200 (accessLevelId/roleId inválidos, username duplicado).
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Registrar 2 usuarios válidos (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/register-bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "users": [
    {
      "username": "bulkuser1@example.com",
      "password": "SecurePassword123",
      "email": "bulkuser1@example.com",
      "phoneNumber": "+50255551111",
      "accessLevelId": 20,
      "roleId": 1001,
      "operatorId": 307,
      "organizationId": 229,
      "divisionId": 192,
      "subdivisionId": 336
    },
    {
      "username": "bulkuser2@example.com",
      "password": "SecurePassword123",
      "email": "bulkuser2@example.com",
      "phoneNumber": "+50255552222",
      "accessLevelId": 20,
      "roleId": 1001,
      "operatorId": 307,
      "organizationId": 229,
      "divisionId": 192,
      "subdivisionId": 336
    }
  ]
}

